PARITY (web DraftRecoveryBanner.tsx → native)
  Data sources (P1/S8 state-holder seam, no HTTP in the view):
    useFormDraft (props)   → DraftRecoverySource emits DraftRecoveryInput (the recovered draft —
                             hasDraft / draftSavedAt / itemNoun — plus the store's load / connectivity state)
                             + discardDraft() (web `discardDraft()`); the view never reads the store directly.
    useTranslation         → DraftRecoveryStrings P1/S10 facade (every literal keyed).
    formatRelativeTime     → DraftRecoveryRelativeTime: VERBATIM web thresholds (diffMin<1 'Just now';
                             <60 '{n}m ago'; diffHrs<24 '{n}h ago'; else locale-aware absolute date), the three
                             relative phrases routed through the facade ({{count}} mirrors web interpolation).
    useMotionPreference    → @Environment(\.accessibilityReduceMotion) honoured by the shared TSSkeleton shimmer.
  Composition: info-toned alert banner (web variant="info" → statusInfo) + info icon (web <Info/>), the
               reassurance copy, and "Use draft" (ghost, sm) + "Discard draft" (secondary, sm) — the exact web
               Button variants/sizes via TSButton. ViewThatFits reflows the controls beneath the message on narrow
               widths (web `flex-wrap`). handleRestore → restore() (dismiss + onRestore?, draft KEPT); handleDiscard
               → discard() (dismiss + source.discardDraft() + onDiscard); the `dismissed` flag is sticky (web
               `setDismissed(true)` → returns null).
  Message branch: itemNoun ? t('draft.restoredItem','{{noun}} draft restored from {{when}}.')
                           : t('draft.restored','Draft restored from {{when}}.'); when = formatRelativeTime ||
                  t('draft.unknownTime','a moment ago'). Empty noun treated as absent (web truthiness). All asserted.
  i18n keys (web → catalog): draft.unknownTime, draft.restoredItem, draft.restored, draft.useDraft,
               draft.discardDraft — all present; + relative-time keys + P4 leaf chrome + freshness keys.
  States rendered (every one, no hidden surface): loading, empty, error, data, stale, offline.

